  "id": "budget-hebq",
  "title": "Transaction detail page with its own URL, opened from the row menu 'Details' item, showing all metadata",
  "description": "New read endpoint returning one transaction with its import info (bank id, provider, connection, account, sync state: imported/edited/blocked, last synced payload, first/last seen) and the full raw provider payload. Client: a detail screen at its own route (e.g. /transaction?id=...), reachable from a new 'Details' item in the transaction row's context menu (Approve/Reject/... menu), deep-linkable, works for manual rows too (shows what exists).",
  "status": "closed",
  "priority": 1,
  "issue_type": "task",
  "owner": null,
