  "labels": [],
  "notes": "Endpoint budget_transactions_get GET /transactions/:id?budget_id=; page /transaction?id=; Details item in row menu (web TxnRowMenu + iOS ContextMenu). Tests: shared 167, api 1202 (compose PG :55432), client 1244 pass; tsc + eslint clean in all three. Web screenshots attached (menu, detail, bank data tree, hand-entered). iOS not run.\nMobile check (375/390/768/1400, web): detail page has no horizontal scroll, bank data tree wraps long keys/values, Copy buttons reachable. Fixed in d1bf887 on tk/budget-hebq: (1) row menu now renders in a transparent Modal: on desktop the card was offset by the rail width and clipped at the right edge, on a phone the '+ Transaction' FAB covered Details/Delete; (2) BudgetTabs backBehavior=history: the detail page's back button went to Overview instead of the register (also fixes import's 'back to where you came from'); (3) on a phone the header amount sits under the payee (a long amount squeezed the title). Evidence before ev-85d5a8 ev-a3b86a ev-5481f7, after ev-45a38f ev-e35453 ev-50d59a ev-4ab25b. client tsc/eslint/bun test pass.\nlanded outside tk close at d1bf887 (branch tk/budget-hebq merged into main by hand)\nMerged to main (d3e8613, d1bf887): /transaction?id= detail page (Details, Import, Bank data tree, Last synced fields), Details item in row menu (web+iOS), mobile pass at 375/390/768/1400 (evidence ev-45a38f ev-e35453 ev-50d59a ev-4ab25b), row menu in Modal fixes rail-offset clipping + FAB overlap. All packages green.",
  "design": null,
